      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at expanding our component sourcing for next year. We're torn between looking at suppliers in Vietnam vs Nigeria. Can you give me a quick breakdown of the general reliability and the business culture differences I should expect in those two markets? Just trying to gauge the risk levels. Thanks.",
